      "content": "Sorry, that last message came through as a bunch of nonsense/gibberish. I think there might have been a glitch? \n\nCould you try rephrasing that last part? I'm specifically looking for how sociologists describe the two different groups—the people moving into these \"revitalized\" areas and the people who are being displaced. What are the qualitative differences in how they are characterized in urban studies?",
